<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">ranged-combat</ansi> skill

The <ansi fg="skill">ranged-combat</ansi> skill governs your proficiency
with ranged weapons — bows, crossbows, and thrown weapons.
Higher ranks improve your hit chance and damage at range.

Ranged-combat improves through use. Firing ranged weapons with
the <ansi fg="command">shoot</ansi> command advances this skill.

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help shoot</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help skills</ansi>
